{"description":"Runs the offline pytest suite whenever a source or test file is edited, so a broken parser, normaliser, or takeover rule is caught in the same session that introduced it.","enabled":true,"name":"Pytest on save","then":{"command":"if [ -x .venv/bin/python ]; then .venv/bin/python -m pytest -q; else python3 -m pytest -q; fi","type":"runCommand"},"version":"1","when":{"patterns":["src/**/*.py","tests/**/*.py"],"type":"fileEdited"}}